# Mobile UI project

Agent skill: [.cursor/skills/mobile-agent/SKILL.md](../skills/mobile-agent/SKILL.md)

## Package

`packages/mobile-ui/` — `@webonone/mobile-ui`. React Native + NativeWind primitives for the Expo app. **Not** `@webonone/ui-kit`.

## Build model

- Source-only exports via `packages/mobile-ui/src/index.ts` — no `dist/` build.
- Metro transpiles source in dev; `npm run type-check` validates types.
- Do not import from web service frontends.

## Styling

- NativeWind (`className`) with tokens from `@webonone/theme`.
- Use `cn()` from `packages/mobile-ui/src/lib/cn.ts` for conditional classes.
- `ThemeProvider` wraps the app; use `useThemeColors` / `useThemedControlIconColor` for themed icons.

## Adding primitives

1. Add component under `packages/mobile-ui/src/components/` (or `layouts/`).
2. Export from `packages/mobile-ui/src/index.ts`.
3. Add showcase entry in `mobile/src/features/kit/` (`/dev/kit` route).
4. Run `npm run type-check -w @webonone/mobile-ui`.

## Verification

```bash
npm run type-check -w @webonone/mobile-ui
npm run type-check -w @webonone/mobile
```
